@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Airport Transfer & Car Rental Services in Davao | Reliable, On‑Time, Professional";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Experience reliable airport transfer and car rental services in Davao. Hassle-free pickup and drop-off at Davao International Airport with a variety of well-maintained vehicles.";
}

<nav aria-label="breadcrumb">
    <ol class="breadcrumb">
        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/Home/OurServices">Services</a></li>
        <li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Davao Airport Car Rental</li>
    </ol>
</nav>

<section class="service-header">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="service-title">Davao Airport Car Rental</h1>
        <p class="service-subtitle">
            Fast, convenient, and reliable car rental service at Davao International Airport. Enjoy smooth airport pickup and drop-off with well-maintained vehicles.
        </p>
        <p>
            After landing at Francisco Bangoy International Airport (DVO), you're only minutes from Davao City. What you choose next can affect the rest of your trip. Airport taxis might mean long lines, fixed routes, or unwanted stops. Public transport is harder with luggage, children, or a late arrival. Renting a car puts you in control and lets you explore Davao on your own schedule.
        </p>

        @if (ViewBag.CtaBox != null)
        {
            @await Html.PartialAsync("_CtaBox", (App2025.Portal.Models.CtaBoxViewModel)ViewBag.CtaBox)
        }

    </div>
</section>

<section class="service-content">
    <div class="container">

        <h2 id="benefits">Why Choose Our Airport Car Rental Service?</h2>
        <p>Renting a Car at Davao Airport Makes Travel Easier.</p>
        <p>
            Renting a car from Davao Airport makes things easier once you land. You choose the route instead of dealing with detours or waiting for several rides. It can take you straight to your hotel, a beach spot, or nearby places such as Tagum and the Samal Island ferry terminal. Families and groups get more space, comfort, and privacy than they would in separate taxis. A rental also helps with late arrivals and busy travel times, when finding a ride may take extra time.
        </p>

        <h3>Fast & Easy Airport Pickup</h3>
        <p>
            Our <strong>Davao Airport Car Rental</strong> service ensures a seamless travel experience from the moment you land.
            Whether you're a tourist, business traveler, or returning resident, we provide clean, comfortable, and reliable vehicles ready for airport pickup or drop-off.
        </p>
        <p>
            Skip the long queues and delays. Our team will meet you at the airport arrival area and assist you with your rental vehicle immediately.
        </p>

        <h3>Clean & Well-Maintained Vehicles</h3>
        <p>
            Choose from sedans, SUVs, vans, and premium units ideal for solo travelers, families, or business trips.
        </p>

        <h2 id="fleet">Available Fleet for Airport Rentals</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Compact & Mid-size Sedans</li>
            <li>Premium SUVs</li>
            <li>Family Vans</li>
            <li>Tour Vehicles</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="service-area">Service Area</h2>
        <p>
            We serve <strong>Davao International Airport (Francisco Bangoy International Airport)</strong> and nearby areas including Lanang, Buhangin, Sasa, and downtown Davao City.
        </p>




        <h3>Quick Decision Guide When Renting a Car in Davao</h3>
        <p>
            Choosing a rental car in Davao is easier when you match the vehicle to your plans, budget, and driving needs. A small car may suit city trips and tight parking, while an SUV offers more room and comfort for longer drives or rougher roads. Use this guide to compare the key details before booking.
        </p>
        <ol>
            <li>Car types and the best uses for each</li>
            <li>Rental costs, daily rates, deposits, fuel, and other factors that affect the final price</li>
            <li>Rental rules and required documents, including a valid license and identification</li>
            <li>Routes and destinations, such as city attractions, coastal drives, and trips toward Samal Island or nearby towns</li>
        </ol>

        <h3>Choosing the Right Vehicle for Your Davao Tour</h3>
        <p>
            <strong>Small sedan or hatchback:</strong> A small car is a good fit for one to three people, especially on short trips around town. It slips into tight parking spaces more easily and usually burns less fuel than a larger car. A couple visiting busy town centers, for instance, may save both time and money with a hatchback.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>MPV:</strong> An MPV works well for families or groups with several large bags. It gives passengers more room than a sedan without the size and higher fuel use of a large SUV. That extra space comes in handy for airport transfers and week-long trips.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>SUV:</strong> An SUV makes more sense for mountain roads, long drives, and rough routes. It has more ground clearance and room for luggage, though the rental cost and fuel bill will usually be higher.
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Van with driver:</strong> A van is a practical choice for larger groups traveling together. Since a driver is included, everyone can leave the traffic, parking, and unfamiliar local roads to someone else.
        </p>

        <h3>Local Airport Traffic Insight</h3>
        <p>
            The Civil Aviation Authority of the Philippines (CAAP) reported 4.39 million passengers at Davao International Airport in 2025. That total made it the busiest airport operated by CAAP in the Philippines.
        </p>
        <p>
            Passenger numbers also rise during busy travel dates. During Holy Week, the airport handled 112,322 passengers in a single travel period. With more people arriving and leaving at once, rental cars can become harder to find, especially around major holidays.
        </p>
        <p>
            Traffic changes throughout the year based on holiday trips, seasonal demand, and available flight schedules. Travelers who need a rental car should reserve one before arriving, rather than waiting until they reach the airport. A car booked early can also save time after a late flight or during a crowded arrival period.
        </p>

        <h3>Key Airport Details</h3>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Airport Name:</strong> Francisco Bangoy International Airport</li>
            <li><strong>Common Name:</strong> Davao International Airport</li>
            <li><strong>Airport Code:</strong> DVO</li>
            <li><strong>Location:</strong> Sasa District, Davao City</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Book Your Car Before You Arrive at Davao Airport</h3>
        <p>
            Send the rental company the main details before your flight. Give them your arrival date, landing time, flight number, passenger count, number of bags, and driver's age. Let them know where you plan to go, whether that's Davao City, Samal Island, or nearby towns.
        </p>
        <p>
            Your flight number lets the rental staff check for delays and change your pickup plans. If the flight comes in late, they can move the meeting time without making several calls. An evening flight delay, for example, might mean the car has to wait longer at the airport.
        </p>
        <p>
            Reserve early for Christmas and New Year, Holy Week, long weekends, school breaks, and big city events or festivals. Cars may run out fast on those dates, especially those with extra seats, roomy trunks, or child seats.
        </p>


        
        @if (ViewBag.CtaBox != null)
        {
            @await Html.PartialAsync("_CtaBox", (App2025.Portal.Models.CtaBoxViewModel)ViewBag.CtaBox)
        }

        <hr />

        <div class="internal-links">
            <h3>Explore Other Services</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="/Services/Davao-tour-car-rental">Davao Tour Car Rental</a></li>
                <li><a href="/Services/Corporate-car-rental">Corporate Car Rental</a></li>
                <li><a href="/Services/car-rental-with-driver">Car Rental With Driver</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>



